417771 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417774 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81133" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417774 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417774 #edb/ref 1071 "If $Y={20,22,24,…,180},$ which collection of subsets of $Y$ is a partition of $Y?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417774 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2504f101-1688-516e-9a69-2239c6d88288" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417774 #edb/ref 1074 "A partition of a set $Y$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $Y$ where every element of $Y$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{20,22,24,…,60},{62,64,66,…,120},{122,124,126,…,180}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${{20,22,24,…,70},{140,142,144,…,180}}$ is not a partition because some elements of $Y,$ such as $72,74,…,138,$ do not appear in any subsets.\n\n- ${{20,22,24,…,80},{66,68,70,…,180}}$ is not a partition because the elements $66,68,…,80$ appear in both subsets.\n\n- ${{2,4,6,…,180}}$ is not a partition because it contains many elements, such as $2,4,…,20,$ that do not appear in $Y.$\n\n- ${{20,22,24,26},{27,28,29,…,180}}$ is not a partition because it contains many elements, such as $27$ and $29,$ that do not appear in $Y.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417775 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417770 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417775 #edb/ref 1069 "q-105882" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417775 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417775 #edb/ref 1071 "If $T={0,2,4,6,8,10}$, which collection of subsets of $T$ is a partition of $T?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417775 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "84e33efb-d3f8-5005-acd9-dce160c0ccce" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417775 #edb/ref 1074 "A partition of a set $T$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $T$ where every element of $T$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${∅,{0,2,4,6,8},{10}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${{0,2,4,6,8,10,12}}$ is not a partition because the element $12$ does not appear in $T.$\n\n- ${{0,10},{2},{4,8}}$ is not a partition because the element $6\\in T$ does not appear in any subset.\n\n- ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8,10}}$ is not a partition because the element $10$ appears in two subsets." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417776 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417773 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417776 #edb/ref 1069 "q-1277" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417776 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417776 #edb/ref 1071 "If $B={-2,-1,0,1,2}$, which collection of subsets of $B$ is a partition of $B?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417776 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "9baec781-6727-5070-ba93-d0e0e2886415" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417776 #edb/ref 1074 "A partition of a set $B$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $B$ where every element of $B$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{-2,0},{-1,1},{2}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${{-2,-1},{-1,1},{0}}$ is not a partition because the element $-1$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- ${{-2,-1},{-1,0},{1,2}}$ is not a partition because the element $-1$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- ${{-2,-1,0},{-2,2},{-2,1},{-1,0}}$ is not a partition because the elements $-2,$ $-1$ and $0$ appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- ${∅,{-2,-1},{0,1,2}}$  is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417777 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186417769 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417777 #edb/ref 1069 "q-81136" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417777 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186417777 #edb/ref 1071 "If $X={f,g,h,i,j,k,l},$ which collection of subsets of $X$ is a partition of $X?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186